{"id":"07021","root":"uni07021_1","name":{"ja":"少女時子","en":"Girl Tokiko"},"title":null,"displayName":{"ja":"少女時子","en":"Girl Tokiko"},"aliases":["Young Tokiko"],"element":"Spiritual","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","roles":[],"traits":["Taimanin"],"release":"2023-09-01","limited":true,"characterId":412,"profile":{"ja":"ふうま時子の少女時代。主人公・ふうま小太郎の腹違いの姉。生まれるとすぐふうまの家に代々仕えている執事の家に養女に出された。ふうま宗家の当主・ふうま弾正が反乱を起こし敗死すると、新たな当主となった幼い主人公を守り抜き、何としてもふうま宗家を潰すまいと奔走する。若くして自在に邪眼“千里眼”を操り、戦闘術やクナイの扱いにおいても大人と互角に渡り合うほどである。","en":"She is Fuuma Tokiko in her younger years, the half-sister of Fuuma Kotaro. After being born, she was immediately sent to the family of the long-serving butler of the Fuuma household as an adopted daughter. When the head of the Fuuma family, Fuuma Danjo, rebelled and was defeated, she dedicated herself to protecting the young new head, Fuuma Kotaro, and worked tirelessly to prevent the downfall of the Fuuma family. Even at a young age, she can freely control the evil eye \"Senrigan\" and is on par with adults in combat techniques and kunai handling."},"illustrator":"カガミ","voiceActor":"向井れん","forms":[{"id":"uni07021_1","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1112,2224],"sp":[170,170],"atk":[211,422],"def":[115,230],"spd":[66,66],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":41,"skills":["3","1990001"],"evolve":[["evo00007",50],["evo00008",25],["evo00009",25],["evo00023",30],["evo00020",10]]},{"id":"uni07021_2","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","levelMax":90,"stats":{"hp":[1674,3348],"sp":[250,250],"atk":[353,706],"def":[161,322],"spd":[66,66],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":41,"skills":["3","1990001","1990002"],"evolve":[["evo00016",10],["evo00017",5],["evo00023",50],["evo00020",30],["evo01023",10]]},{"id":"uni07021_3","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","levelMax":100,"stats":{"hp":[2236,4474],"sp":[330,330],"atk":[497,999],"def":[209,411],"spd":[66,66],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":41,"skills":["3","1990001","1990002","1990003"]}],"skills":{"3":{"slot":"attack","id":3,"name":null,"hits":2